488	    <h3>Not drawn, and why</h3>
489	    <ul>
490	      <li><b>R-9, two people changing one task at once:</b> no screen state. The later change wins and nobody is told (todo_list.md § Deliberate non-goals).</li>
491	      <li><b><code>todo_task_empty_patch</code></b> (“No change was given. The task is unchanged.”): this screen never sends a change without a text or a done mark.</li>
492	      <li><b>The standard validation refusal</b> (FastAPI's list): only a malformed request earns it, and this screen never sends one.</li>
493	      <li><b>Live updates:</b> a non-goal; other people's changes appear when the list is read again (R-3.5).</li>
494	      <li><b>Other window classes:</b> <code>.specconf/stack.json</code> § <code>window_classes</code> declares none, and a phone layout is a named non-goal (spec/invariants.md). The column narrows with the window, as the guestbook's does.</li>
495	      <li><b>Other languages:</b> English only (Q-7, conventions.md § Language).</li>
496	      <li><b>A dark theme:</b> withdrawn (system-states.md § One palette); <code>theme.css</code> has one palette.</li>
497	      <li><b>Search, filters, pages, “clear all done”, reordering, dates, owners:</b> non-goals (todo_list.md).</li>
498	      <li><b>Focus inside the dialog, the Tab cycle, Escape:</b> the Modal primitive's behaviour, unchanged; described under P8, not drawable.</li>
499	      <li><b>A write that waits a long time</b> (E-27): nothing beyond P10's markers, which stay until the answer.</li>
500	      <li><b>A largest number of tasks:</b> none is set (todo_list.md § Open questions); P15 shows 101.</li>
501	      <li><b>The guestbook's own states:</b> unchanged; P17 draws only what the frame changes there.</li>
502	    </ul>
